#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Cakeman — a Pac-Man-style maze chase for the Linux terminal.

  cakeman            # play
  cakeman --help     # options

Controls:
  ←→↑↓ / WASD / HJKL   steer (buffered — turn early, it remembers)
  ESC / P              pause menu (Continue · Restart · Settings · Quit)
  R                    quick restart
  Q                    quit
  M                    toggle color (mono)

Eat every crumb to clear the maze. Power treats send the ghosts running —
chase them down for 200 → 400 → 800 → 1600. Three lives per run.

Skins change every character on screen (you, the four ghosts, crumbs,
walls); themes recolor the maze. Both live in the Settings menu and are
remembered between runs. Requires only the Python standard library.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

